  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"111\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">全新Discord伺服器！提供專屬支援與更新通知。</span></h1><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/275/started-png.png\" alt=\"started\" width=\"1024\" height=\"153\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>簡易木材切割器</strong> </span>讓木工製作更簡單！透過這個模組，你只需要用切石機將<strong>一塊木頭板材</strong>轉換成任何木質變體——樓梯、半磚、柵欄、活板門等等。不再需要浪費一堆堆的木板，製作木塊從未如此輕鬆！</h1><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/284/line-png.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1024\" height=\"43\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">在工作台中用（9根）木棍合成（<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">製作板材</span>）</h1><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/273/craftingplanks-png.png\" alt=\"recipe\" width=\"763\" height=\"212\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">將（<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">製作板材</span>）放入切石機，即可製作任何你想要的木製品！</h1><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/271/tab-2-png.png\" alt=\"snow one\" width=\"691\" height=\"270\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/270/tab-1-png.png\" alt=\"recipe 2\" width=\"682\" height=\"270\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">想要更多模組嗎？我們有超過60+個模組等你來探索！點擊下方連結 ;) <img src=\"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/jtv_user_pictures/0210b039-e874-4d2e-8b05-d839d92d13fe-profile_image-150x150.png\" alt=\"icon\" width=\"99\" height=\"99\"></span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/smartstreamlabs/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/smartstreamlabs/projects</a></span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/290/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intelij\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">此模組使用IntelliJ開發</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">#非贊助內容</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">產品聲明：非官方Minecraft產品。未經Mojang或Microsoft認可或關聯</span></h1>",
